## 🚫 Blocklists for Ads, Trackers & Malware

Little Snitch supports ready-made blocklists that can add groups of rules for specific categories of unwanted network activity.

<div style="text-align:left;">

* 🚫 **Tracker Lists** — Block connections associated with tracking.
* 📢 **Ad Lists** — Add rules targeting advertising-related connections.
* 🦠 **Malware Lists** — Add prepared rules for malware-related destinations.
* 🔄 **Automatic Updates** — Little Snitch 6 includes enhanced blocklist support with automatic updates.
* 🧩 **Rule Groups** — Organize rules around specific connection topics.
* 📋 **Usage Data** — Review how often individual blocklist entries are triggered.

</div>

