## ⚙️ Installation & First Setup

Little Snitch installs into the Applications folder and requires macOS approval for its network filtering system extension during first setup.

<div style="text-align:left;">

| 🔢 **Step** | 🛠️ **Setup Action**                                          |
| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |
| 1️⃣         | 📥 **Download Little Snitch** from the official source        |
| 2️⃣         | 📂 **Move the App** into Applications                         |
| 3️⃣         | 🚀 **Launch Little Snitch**                                   |
| 4️⃣         | 📜 **Accept the License Agreement**                           |
| 5️⃣         | 🔐 **Allow Network Filtering** when macOS requests permission |
| 6️⃣         | ⚙️ **Open System Settings** when prompted                     |
| 7️⃣         | 🛡️ **Allow the System Extension**                            |
| 8️⃣         | 🔔 **Configure Alerts & Rules**                               |
| 9️⃣         | 🌐 **Start Monitoring Connections**                           |

</div>

