## 🆕 Little Snitch 6.5 – Current Release

The current official release is **Little Snitch 6.5 (7303)**, released September 8, 2026. It adds compatibility with macOS 27 Golden Gate, app-bundle integrity monitoring while the app is running, improvements to location filtering and search fields, experimental NAT64 support, and several fixes including encrypted-DNS improvements.

<div style="text-align:left;">

* 🆕 **Version 6.5** — Current stable release.
* 🍏 **macOS 27 Support** — Updated for Golden Gate.
* 🛡️ **App Integrity Monitoring** — Checks app-bundle integrity while running.
* 🗺️ **Map Filtering** — Improved location filter behavior.
* 🔎 **Search UI** — Improved inactive-window search fields.
* 🌐 **NAT64** — Experimental RFC 6052 implementation.
* 🔐 **Encrypted DNS** — Additional fixes and improvements.
* 🛠️ **Stability** — Various bug fixes and under-the-hood improvements.

</div>

