## 💳 Demo Mode & License

Little Snitch can be used in demo mode without entering a license key. The official download page states that demo mode provides the same protection and functionality as the full version, with the firewall deactivating after three hours of use and Network Monitor available for 30 days after first installation.

<div style="text-align:left;">

* 🆓 **Demo Mode** — Test Little Snitch without immediately entering a license key.
* 🛡️ **Firewall Trial** — Firewall protection runs for three hours at a time in demo mode.
* 🔄 **Restart Demo** — The firewall demo can be reactivated manually.
* 📊 **Network Monitor** — Available for 30 days after first installation.
* 🔑 **Full Version** — Enter a valid license key to remove demo limitations.

